OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after man found in
OL,4,Awheelie bin
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder following the discovery of a
OL,8,Fdead body found "partially in a wheeled
OL,9,Fbin" in the West Hoe area of Plymouth
OL,11,FDevon and Cornwall Police said an
OL,12,Finvestigation was launched at 06:40 BST
OL,13,Fon Wednesday after a man's body was
OL,14,Ffound off Grand Parade.
OL,16,FThe force said a man in his 30s is in
OL,17,Fpolice custody. It added the identity
OL,18,Fof the dead man is yet to be confirmed.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
