OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after man found in
OL,4,Awheelie bin
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Insp Chris Lithgow said the
OL,7,Finvestigation was still at an "early
OL,8,Fstage" with a cordon remaining in place
OL,9,Fand anyone with information should
OL,10,Fcontact police.
